 <h3><u>Bohot door chale jayenge</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haai sakina...4<br> Daswi ki sahar hone se pehle<br> Beti ko bulaya baba ne<br> Or roke ye kaha<br> Aa seene pe soja aakhari baar<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> Kal hum na rahenge<br> Is khaak me hum so jayenge</p> 
  <p>Bohot door chale jayenge...<br> Sakina... Baba...<br> Bohot door chale jayenge...</p> 
  <p>Is dasht me soyenge<br> Tere chahane waale<br> Allah tujhe beta<br> Yatimi se bachale<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> Tum dhundogi humko<br> Hum lout ke ghar na ayenge</p> 
  <p>Tadpogi yaha tum bi<br> Waha dasht me hum bi<br> Hum dono ko sehne hai<br> Ye furkat ke sitam bi<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> Aa bait mere paas<br> Ab khwaab me hi mil payenge</p> 
  <p>Jee bhar ke mohabbat ka<br> Me izhar tho karlu<br> Aagosh me aajao<br> Tumhe pyaar tho karlu<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> Dil tham lo beta<br> Hum tumse juda ho jayenge</p> 
  <p>Wo Aouno Mohammad ho<br> Wo Kasim ho ke Akbar<br> Hur ho ke Habibi ibne<br> Mazahir ho ke Asghar<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> De denge dilase<br> Maqtal me sabi so jayenge</p> 
  <p>Na dhoop ki shiddat se<br> Na tadpogi sitam se<br> Ha pyaas ka shikwa tho<br> Karogi kabi humse<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> Kal denge chacha jaan<br> Jab paani lene jayenge</p> 
  <p>Seene pe kabi maa ke<br> Tujhe sona padega<br> Pehlu me puphi jaan ke<br> Tujhe sona padega<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> Aa seene pe soja<br> Kal ye bi nahi keh payenge</p> 
  <p>Ab tera mukaddar hai<br> Safar or aseeri<br> Bazar bi jaana hai<br> Tho zindane sitam bi<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> Pehnogi rasan jab<br> Hum tumko bohot yaad aayenge</p> 
  <p>Aadat kaha seene ke<br> Siwa sone ki beta<br> Chin jayega kal tujhse<br> Tere baba ka seena<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> Hum daghe yateemi<br> Ay beta tujhe de jayenge</p> 
  <p>Jumle ye shahe deen ke<br> Fugha ban gaye mazhar<br> Jo nohay ki surat me<br> Hai irfan ke lab par<br> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ye aakhari shab hai........<br> Kal hum na rahenge<br> Is khaak me hum so jayenge</p> 
  <p>Bohot door chale jayenge...<br> Sakina... Baba...<br> Bohot door chale jayenge...</p> 
